(II)--Lord of the Yavanas: adopted the daughter of काल as his sister; his brother was प्रज्वार;
1: भा. IV. २७. २३ and ३०.
when attack- ing the city of पुरञ्जन he captured पुरञ्जन himself;
2: Ib. IV. २८. २२-23.
allegorically death; the Yavanas represent mental worries.
3: Ib. IV. २९. २२, २३.
